  "historyNote": "#4901, eff 8-3-90; ss by #6298, INTERIM, eff 8-3-96, EXPIRES: 12-1-96; ss by #6338, eff 9-25-96; ss by #8182, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRED: 3-24-05 New. #8405, eff 8-2-05, (formerly Saf-C 1803.01); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24 New. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
